{
  "previous_id": "S01",
  "current_id": "S02",
  "verdict": "uncertain",
  "segment_summary": {
    "zh": "从带黑金蝴蝶画的边桌旁出发，画面先出现小幅转向，但仍在看边桌；随后近距离正面看到一组白色柜门与敞开搁架（F10、F19）；之后F28又一次正面看到同一张黑金画边桌；最后进入一条走廊，左侧墙上挂有两幅植物装裱画，右前方有一个敞开门口，门内可见洗手台、镜子等卫生间式设施（F37、F38）。全程未见卧室、电视、梳妆柜、床或窗户。",
    "en": "Starting beside the console table with the black-and-gold butterfly painting, the view shifted slightly but still faced the table; then white cabinet doors and open shelving were seen up close and head-on (F10, F19); then at F28 the same black-and-gold console table was again in front of the camera; finally a corridor appeared with two framed plant pictures on the left wall and an open doorway ahead-right revealing bathroom-like fixtures such as a vanity and mirror (F37, F38). No bedroom, TV, dresser, bed, or window was seen."
  },
  "reason": {
    "zh": "终点走廊左侧确有两幅植物画，与指令中的墙面参照相符，但F28再次正面出现同一张黑金画边桌，F10/F19又是贴近正面看白色柜体，这一顺序难以用“右转离开边桌、直行进入走廊”的连续直行来解释，因此本段实际通行路线与是否已完成走廊要求无法可靠确认；走廊尽头的门洞尚未确认已通过。",
    "en": "The corridor at the endpoint does have two framed plant pictures on its left wall, matching the described landmark, but the same black-and-gold console table reappears directly ahead at F28, and F10/F19 are close, head-on views of white cabinets; this sequence is hard to explain as a continuous straight walk away from the console table into the hallway. Thus the actual traversal and whether the hallway requirement was met cannot be reliably confirmed, and the doorway at the end of the corridor is not confirmed as passed."
  },
  "instruction_evidence": [
    {
      "quote_en": "Turn right, moving away from the console table with the black and gold painting.",
      "quote_zh": "右转，离开那张挂着黑金画的边桌。"
    },
    {
      "quote_en": "keeping the wall with two framed plant pictures on your left and a storage unit on your right",
      "quote_zh": "让挂有两幅植物装裱画的那面墙保持在你的左侧，储物柜在你的右侧。"
    },
    {
      "quote_en": "Continue straight past an open doorway leading to a bathroom on your right.",
      "quote_zh": "继续直行，经过右侧一个通向卫生间的敞开门口。"
    }
  ],
  "visual_evidence": [
    {
      "frames": [0, 1, 28],
      "description": {
        "zh": "F0/F1中黑金蝴蝶画边桌位于正前方，窗帘与照片在左侧；F28又近距离正面出现同一张边桌（小象摆件、书本、花瓶及画作一致），说明镜头面前再次出现起始参照物，而非持续远离。",
        "en": "In F0/F1 the console table with the black-and-gold butterfly painting is directly ahead, with the curtain and photos on the left; at F28 the same table (same elephant figurine, books, vase, painting) again appears up close in front of the camera, meaning the starting landmark reappears before the camera instead of receding."
      }
    },
    {
      "frames": [10, 19],
      "description": {
        "zh": "白色柜门与把手几乎占满画面，F10右侧可见敞开搁架，F19左缘为浅木色门框；只能确认经过或正对大型储物柜体，无法确认它在行进方向右侧还是阻挡在前方。",
        "en": "White cabinet doors and handles fill almost the whole frame, with open shelving visible on the right in F10 and a light-wood frame at the left edge in F19; it can only be confirmed that large storage cabinets were passed or faced, not whether they were on the right of the travel direction or blocking the way."
      }
    },
    {
      "frames": [37, 38],
      "description": {
        "zh": "走廊左侧墙面挂有两幅植物装裱画，F38右前方出现敞开门口，门内可见洗手台、镜子和毛巾架等设施；尚不能确认已穿过该门口或进入卧室。",
        "en": "The corridor's left wall bears two framed plant pictures, and in F38 an open doorway appears ahead-right with a vanity, mirror, and towel rail visible inside; there is no confirmation that the doorway was passed through or that a bedroom was entered."
      }
    }
  ],
  "semantic_progress": null,
  "uncertainties": [
    {
      "zh": "F28再次正面出现黑金画边桌，该段是否发生了回头或绕行、从而并非“离开边桌后直行进入走廊”，无法确定。",
      "en": "Whether the reappearance of the black-and-gold console table at F28 indicates turning back or looping around rather than walking straight away from it into the hallway cannot be determined."
    },
    {
      "zh": "F10/F19的白色柜体是否就是指令中“右侧的储物柜”，以及当时是沿其侧面通过还是正面接近，无法确定。",
      "en": "Whether the white cabinets in F10/F19 are the 'storage unit on your right' in the instruction, and whether they were passed along their side or approached head-on, cannot be determined."
    },
    {
      "zh": "F38右前方的敞开门口是否就是“通向卫生间的门口”，以及是否已经通过该门口、是否到达下一处需左转的卧室门口，尚未确认。",
      "en": "Whether the open doorway ahead-right in F38 is the doorway leading to the bathroom, whether it has been passed, and whether the next doorway requiring a left turn into the bedroom has been reached remain unconfirmed."
    }
  ]
}
